# #152 drills and multi-hit aerials: Warden's up air (3 kicks) and Falling Knives. Warden a against Warden b; syntax and checks: smashcraft:docs/native-bot-session.md.
#! chat -dev quick hero warden
# Both dash in, close; eda5e178f2 made Maiev grippier, so both hold the dash 3 frames (variant run 39025737993).
40 b stick -1 0
43 b stick 0 0
50 a stick 1 0
53 a stick 0 0
# Up air under b, which jumped first.
94 b tap B 8
100 a tap B 8
101 a stick 0.6 0
113 a cstick 0 1
113 a stick 0 0
117 a cstick 0 0
# Frames saved on hits (native only; illustration for the look box).
117 a capture
127 a capture
# Falling Knives on a standing b, just ahead of a.
200 a tap B 8
201 a stick -0.3 0
213 a cstick 0 -1
213 a stick 0 0
217 a cstick 0 0
# Frames saved on hits (native only; illustration for the look box).
219 a capture
231 a capture
